  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "No. of $M$ atoms $=\\frac{1}{4} \\times 4+1=1+1=2$\r\n\r\nNo. of $X$ atoms $=\\frac{1}{2} \\times 6+\\frac{1}{8} \\times 8=3+1=4$\r\n\r\nSo, formula $=M_{2} X_{4}=M X_{2}$",
